    {
      "id": "import",
      "title": "Import",
      "members": [],
      "paragraphs": [
        "A single texture page within a GlyphAtlas. Glyphs are packed into the page using a shelf-bin algorithm.",
        "In `'sdf'` mode the page owns a `DataTexture` (`r8`) populated by tiny-sdf output. In `'color'` mode a Canvas 2D context preserves full glyph colours for emoji."
      ],
      "importLine": "import { AtlasPage } from '@codexo/exojs'",
      "sourceLink": null
    },
